{"meta":{"id":"api-contract","category":"aide/common-rules","title":"API 계약 (응답 봉투·헤더·데이터 형식)","subtitle":"","summary":"ok/data/meta/error 응답 봉투와 에러 코드, X-Request-ID·인증 헤더, 인코딩·snake_case·ISO 일시·null·CSV·DB 컬럼 기본값","tags":["aide","규칙","api"],"color":"indigo","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-indigo","source":"aide_agents/1-rules","updatedAt":"2026-10-18"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-indigo-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 border border-indigo-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></span>1-rules</span>\r\n<span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-stone-400 font-serif\">2026-10-18</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">API 계약 (응답 봉투·헤더·데이터 형식)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-indigo-50/70 border border-indigo-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> ok/data/meta/error 응답 봉투와 에러 코드, X-Request-ID·인증 헤더, 인코딩·snake_case·ISO 일시·null·CSV·DB 컬럼 기본값</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">우선순위</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">서버·서비스 사이에 주고받는 형식의 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">기본값</strong> — 언어와 무관하게 같은 값을 쓰면 따로 만든 서비스도 경계에서 바로 붙는다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">프로젝트 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>AGENTS.md</code>·구조 문서의 계약·외부 규격이 다르게 정하면 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">그쪽이 우선</strong>, 바꾼 값은 그 계약 문서에 적는다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">한 프로젝트(합칠 서비스 묶음) 안에서는 한 가지로 통일</span></div></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">응답 봉투</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">json</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">{ &quot;ok&quot;: true, &quot;data&quot;: { &quot;user_id&quot;: 12, &quot;name&quot;: &quot;홍길동&quot; } }\r\n{ &quot;ok&quot;: true, &quot;data&quot;: [ ... ], &quot;meta&quot;: { &quot;page&quot;: 1, &quot;size&quot;: 20, &quot;total&quot;: 134 } }\r\n{ &quot;ok&quot;: false,\r\n  &quot;error&quot;: { &quot;code&quot;: &quot;USER_NOT_FOUND&quot;, &quot;message&quot;: &quot;사용자를 찾을 수 없습니다.&quot;,\r\n             &quot;step&quot;: &quot;user.lookup&quot;, &quot;request_id&quot;: &quot;7f3c2a9e-...&quot; } }</pre></div><div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">최상위 키는 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>ok</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>data</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>meta</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>error</code>만. 결과가 없어도 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>data</code> 키는 둔다(단건 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>null</code>, 목록 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>[]</code>)</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">페이지는 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>page</code>(1부터)·<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>size</code>·<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>total</code>, 커서 방식은 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>next_cursor</code></span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">HTTP 상태코드도 실제 결과대로 — &quot;항상 200 + <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>ok:false</code>&quot; 금지. <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>ok</code>와 상태코드는 같은 쪽을 가리킨다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">파일 다운로드·스트리밍·헬스체크는 봉투를 씌우지 않는다(실패 시에만 봉투 에러 JSON)</span></div></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">에러 필드</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">내용</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>code</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">영문 대문자 snake. 받는 쪽은 이 값으로 분기(<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>message</code>로 분기 금지)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>message</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">사람이 읽는 설명. 스택트레이스·SQL·내부 경로는 로그에만</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>step</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">실패한 단계명 — 구조 문서 단계 표와 같은 이름. 다른 서버 에러를 감쌀 때도 원래 단계 유지</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>request_id</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">요청 헤더 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>X-Request-ID</code> 값 그대로</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">입력 검증 실패는 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>error.details</code>에 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>[{ &quot;field&quot;: &quot;email&quot;, &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;INVALID_FORMAT&quot; }]</code></span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">공통 코드: <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>BAD_REQUEST</code>(400) <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>UNAUTHORIZED</code>(401) <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>FORBIDDEN</code>(403) <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>NOT_FOUND</code>(404) <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>CONFLICT</code>(409) <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>VALIDATION_FAILED</code>(422) <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>INTERNAL_ERROR</code>(500) <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>UPSTREAM_FAILED</code>(502) <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>TIMEOUT</code>(504)</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">봉투는 한 곳에서 — 성공·실패 헬퍼 + 전역 예외 처리기(FastAPI exception_handler, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>@RestControllerAdvice</code>, Express error middleware)</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">이미 다른 응답 형식이 자리 잡힌 프로젝트는 바꾸지 않고 따르며, 다르다는 사실만 보고</span></div></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">공통 헤더</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>X-Request-ID</code> — <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">입구에서 한 번</strong> 만들고(없으면 UUID v4), 다른 서버·큐로 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">그대로 넘기고</strong>, 응답 헤더·<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>error.request_id</code>로 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">돌려주고</strong>, <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">모든 로그 줄</strong>에 남긴다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">요청 ID는 요청 범위 저장소(Python <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>contextvars</code>, Java MDC, Node <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>AsyncLocalStorage</code>)에 — 함수 인자로 끌고 다니지 않는다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">들어온 값이 128자 초과이거나 영문·숫자·<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>-</code>·<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>_</code> 외 문자가 있으면 버리고 새로 만든다(로그 주입 방지)</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">인증은 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>Authorization: Bearer &lt;token&gt;</code> 하나, 서버 간 키는 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>X-Service-Key</code>(값은 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>.env</code>). 쿼리스트링·로그에 토큰을 남기지 않는다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8</code>, 호출자는 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>X-Caller: &lt;서비스명&gt;</code>, API 버전은 경로(<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>/v1/</code>)</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">큐·Redis·배치는 메시지 본문에 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>request_id</code>, 스케줄러 작업은 시작할 때 새 ID(<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>job-</code> 접두사)</span></div></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">데이터 형식</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">항목</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">기본값</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">예 / 쓰지 않는 것</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">문자 인코딩</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">UTF-8</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">엑셀로 열 CSV만 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>utf-8-sig</code>(BOM)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">키·필드 이름</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">snake_case 영문</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>user_id</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>created_at</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">일시</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">ISO 8601 + 타임존 오프셋</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>2026-10-15T14:30:00+09:00</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">날짜만</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>YYYY-MM-DD</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>2026-10-15</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">타임존</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>.env</code>의 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>LOG_TZ</code>(기본 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>Asia/Seoul</code>)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">로그와 같은 기준</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">불리언</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>true</code>/<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>false</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>&quot;Y&quot;/&quot;N&quot;</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>1/0</code> 금지</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">값 없음</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>null</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>&quot;&quot;</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>&quot;-&quot;</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>&quot;N/A&quot;</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>0</code> 금지</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">숫자</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">숫자 타입</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>&quot;123&quot;</code> 문자열 금지</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">큰 정수·금액</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">문자열</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">2^53 초과 ID, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>&quot;12500.50&quot;</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">코드값</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">영문 대문자 snake</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>ACTIVE</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>IN_PROGRESS</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">목록</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">배열</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>&quot;a,b,c&quot;</code> 금지</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">한 이름은 어디서나 같은 뜻 — API 키·CSV 헤더·DB 컬럼에 같은 이름</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">이름에 단위를 붙인다: <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>elapsed_ms</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>size_bytes</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>price_krw</code></span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">camelCase 등 프론트 관례 변환은 경계 한 곳(API 클라이언트·직렬화 설정)에서만</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">CSV는 헤더 한 줄 + RFC 4180, 값 없음은 빈칸. DB 일시는 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>TIMESTAMPTZ</code> 또는 기준 타임존을 COMMENT에, 불리언 없는 DB는 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>TINYINT(1)</code> → API에서 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>true/false</code></span></div></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">체크리스트</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">☐ 성공·실패 모두 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>ok</code>가 있고 HTTP 상태코드와 맞는가, 에러에 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>code</code>·<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>message</code>·<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>step</code>·<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>request_id</code>가 있는가</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">☐ 봉투를 헬퍼·전역 처리기 한 곳에서 만드는가</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">☐ 입구에서만 요청 ID를 만들고, 응답·로그·큐 메시지에 같은 값이 실려 가는가</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">☐ 키·CSV 헤더·DB 컬럼 이름이 같고, 일시에 오프셋이 있는가</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">☐ 기본값과 다르게 정한 것을 계약 문서에 적었는가</span></div></div></div>\r\n","path":"aide/common-rules/api-contract","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"aide","title":"aide","path":"aide"},{"id":"common-rules","title":"1-rules (공통 규칙)","path":"aide/common-rules"}],"hasImage":false}